; Names for the Style Convert Disk converters (src/cnv/*.s), read by
; tools/gen_cnv_s.py (`make cnv-src`).
;
;   STEM 0xADDRESS NAME [; note]
;
; STEM is the converter (GEM_WS2 GEM_WX2 KORG ROLAND SOLTON TECHNICS
; TECHNICS_KN6000). A name given to a routine start applies to every converter
; whose routine has the same code (the "same code" lines in the sources), so a
; shared routine is named once, for any one of them; give one converter's copy a
; line of its own to override that. Other addresses (data, labels inside a
; routine) are named for that converter only.
